.DS_Store
/.build
/.index-build
/Examples/.build

# Generated test app packages and their build trees. One per backend, and the
# name always says which: a default build and a -gtk4 build cannot share a tree,
# because SwiftPM's incremental state records module dependencies and they
# contradict each other. The suffix-less /testapp/.compile-work was removed on
# 2026-09-04 -- it was the fallback, so its contents depended on the host rather
# than on its name, and nobody could tell whether it was safe to delete.
/testapp/.compile-work-*

# The executables compile.zsh copies out of those trees, plus screenshots, run
# logs, and build-manifest.csv2 -- the record of which configuration produced
# each artefact, which lives beside the artefacts it describes and is therefore
# untracked for the same reason they are.
#
# Added 2026-09-07. testapp/README.md has said "neither the output directory
# nor the .compile-work-* build trees are tracked" for some time, and for the
# build trees the line above enforced it; for output/ nothing here did. The
# only thing ignoring it was `testapp/output/` in this checkout's
# .git/info/exclude, which is not committed and does not travel -- so the
# statement was true on this machine and false in a fresh clone, and `git
# status` was clean here either way. That is the shape of the whole problem
# this manifest exists for: a claim that is only accidentally true.
#
# compile.zsh 從那些建置樹複製出來的執行檔，加上截圖、執行 log，以及 build-manifest.csv2
# ——「每個產物是由哪一種組態產生」的紀錄；它與所描述的產物放在一起，因此未納入版控的理由
# 與那些產物完全相同。
#
# 2026-09-07 新增。testapp/README.md 已有一段時間寫著「輸出目錄與 .compile-work-* 建置樹
# 都未被追蹤」，而對建置樹而言，上一行確實落實了它；對 output/ 而言，此處沒有任何一行做到。
# 唯一在忽略它的，是本 checkout 的 .git/info/exclude 中的 `testapp/output/`，那個檔案不會
# 被提交、也不會隨著 repo 走——因此那句話在這台機器上為真、在全新的 clone 中為假，而
# `git status` 兩邊都是乾淨的。那正是這份 manifest 所要解決的問題的形狀：一項只是碰巧為真
# 的主張。
/testapp/output/

# Reusable iOS Simulator bundle assembled by testapp/test_ios.zsh. The
# template is tracked; the copied debugTarget executable and its signature are
# local build output.
/testapp/.bundledApp/
/testapp/.androidApk/
/testapp/.macApp/
/testapp/.android-sdk/

# Held while one Pn is under test, so two tests cannot produce screenshots of
# each other, plus .ui-lock-denied: the last thing the desktop did with our
# synthesised input. Runtime state, never committed. See testapp/ui-lock.zsh.
/testapp/.ui-lock
/testapp/.ui-lock-denied

# The tree SCUI_HOST_BACKENDS_ONLY=1 swift test builds into, for the same reason
# as the two above: it declares a different set of targets, so it cannot share
# /.build. See the note beside the flag in Package.swift.
/.build-hosttest
/Packages
/*.xcodeproj
xcuserdata/
DerivedData/
.swiftpm/xcode/package.xcworkspace/contents.xcworkspacedata
/.vscode
*.pyc
.swiftpm
vcpkg_installed/
*.trace
notes.json
/Tools
.docc-build/
.idea

# A Pn writes this into whatever directory it is launched from. Widened from
# p6-debug-events.log when a P19 run produced p19-debug-events.log -- the name
# is built from the app, so the pattern has to be too.
p*-debug-events.log

# P11's unconditional startup trace, written whether or not --debug is passed --
# see the P11Startup comment for why that one is exempt. Same naming rule as
# above, different suffix, so p*-debug-events.log does not reach it and the file
# turned up untracked after every P11 run.
# P11 的無條件啟動追蹤：無論是否傳入 --debug 都會寫出——理由見 P11Startup 的註解。命名規則
# 與上者相同、後綴不同，因此 p*-debug-events.log 涵蓋不到它，於是每次執行 P11 之後它都會以
# 未追蹤檔案的形式出現。
p*-startup.log

# The same shape, but these names carry no app, so p*- cannot cover them: one is
# written by the replay runner and one by SplitView, both from
# currentDirectoryPath. run.zsh launches by absolute path and never cd's, so
# they land in the repo root rather than testapp/output/ -- which is where the
# docs used to say to look for them.
#
# Untracked rather than committed because they are the output of a run, not a
# record of one. A finding worth keeping goes in bugs/ or a note beside the
# action file, quoted; the file itself is regenerated by the next run and would
# only ever conflict.
#
# 同一種東西，但這兩個名稱不含 app，因此 p*- 涵蓋不到：一個由重放 runner 寫出，一個由
# SplitView 寫出，兩者都取自 currentDirectoryPath。run.zsh 以絕對路徑啟動且從不 cd，所以它們
# 落在 repo 根目錄，而非文件過去所說的 testapp/output/。
#
# 不納入版控而是忽略，因為它們是一次執行的產物，不是那次執行的紀錄。值得保留的發現應寫進
# bugs/ 或動作檔旁的註解並直接引用；檔案本身會被下一次執行覆寫，留著只會造成衝突。
actionfile-replay.log
splitview-debug.log
decoration-debug.log
